INSERT INTO `wp_josinbryh5_posts` VALUES (844,1,'2025-07-23 20:32:19','2025-07-23 20:32:19','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well shucks, this is where I tend to struggle. I\'m not a big fan of talking about myself but since you\'re here, I might as well give it a shot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'ve been making websites since 2015 in a number of platforms. I\'ve been doing specifically WordPress theme and plugin development for the last 7 years and I\'ve gotten to know the platform like the back of my hand. Where I\'ve specialized is in making an outstanding site editing experience while delivering accessible code that SEO teams love. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Who am I besides a web developer? A proud father and avid fan of the outdoors. When not behind the desk you\'ll probably find me on a bike or hiking in the woods by myself or with my family. I\'ve got a young son who I love to spend as much time as possible with (while he still lets me). I also like working with my hands and am the type to install my own water heater to city code. What can I say, I am resourceful and have a super power of figuring things out for the first time. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":514,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://voyager-one.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG_3756-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-514\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','About Me','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2025-07-23 20:32:19','2025-07-23 20:32:19','',2,'https://voyager-one.local/?p=844',0,'revision','',0);
